# {{NAME}}

Blender printables project (`scaffold: blender-bpy`).

## Layout

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `docs/DESIGN.md` | Intent + mode keys for DFM gate |
| `src/build.py` | Parametric headless bpy builder |
| `stl/` | Binary STLs |
| `renders/` | Preview PNGs |
| `scripts/export.sh` | Thin wrapper → pblend |

## Build

```bash
# from skill scripts (or PATH after install)
pblend doctor
pblend run --project "$(pwd)"
pblend gate --project "$(pwd)"
pblend preview --project "$(pwd)"
pblend pack --project "$(pwd)" --version {{VERSION}}
```

Or:

```bash
./scripts/export.sh
```

## Print (P1S)

- Orientation: feet-down (see DESIGN.md)
- Material: PETG preferred; PLA fit-check
- **HARD DFM fail = not done**

